            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Snapline 2.0</h2>
<p>Snapline is now a licensed app. Taking new captures &mdash; screenshots,
recordings, scrolling captures &mdash; requires a license key, entered once in
the activation window.</p>
<p>Everything you have already captured remains yours and stays fully
accessible: History, the Editor, pinning, and export all work without a
license, and always will.</p>
<p>Updates also remain available to every install, licensed or not.</p>
]]></description>
